{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can't a Magical Girl retire in peace?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have lost your powers, but you can still throw a punch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/c47e6baeef12c4b78025a3ed9c367b3a.poster.avif?t=1758316763\" width=552 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/c47e6baeef12c4b78025a3ed9c367b3a.webm?t=1758316763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/c47e6baeef12c4b78025a3ed9c367b3a.mp4?t=1758316763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a Magical Girl who, together with her friends, successfully unionised against their exploitative familiars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After many battles, and with her powers depleted, she began a new life as a retired Magical Girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or so she thought...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/c14bbb0755ec923c4abb021c41db785a.poster.avif?t=1758316763\" width=552 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/c14bbb0755ec923c4abb021c41db785a.webm?t=1758316763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/c14bbb0755ec923c4abb021c41db785a.mp4?t=1758316763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden wave of anti-Magical Girl sentiment has bubbled over into a full scale riot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the source of the misinformation before this whole thing can get even stupider than it already is.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the freshly rage-instilled zombie hordes in scrappy beat-em-up combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-changing multi-character action. Punch magically, swordfight beautifully or bazooka blastily!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-operative 2 player gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your stats at vending machines by drinking questionably coloured beverages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into fights in a legally distinct supermarket carpark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with silly dialog and dorky characters!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/1fc23d0828801461bcaf878e192bf5b5.poster.avif?t=1758316763\" width=552 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/1fc23d0828801461bcaf878e192bf5b5.webm?t=1758316763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791380/extras/1fc23d0828801461bcaf878e192bf5b5.mp4?t=1758316763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand new adventure starring the Hero Hours Contract squad.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(* But you don't have to have played the other games first!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction. Any resemblance to persons living or dead is purely coincidental.</p>","background":"